{
  "package": "database/sql",
  "notes": "database/sql: Go's pool, Tx, Stmt, Rows and Scan conversions ported from sql.go and convert.go on std::sync; any becomes driver::Arg (arguments) and &mut dyn Scanner (destinations); optional driver interfaces are as_* accessors; RawBytes copies; Go strings with invalid UTF-8 scan into String lossily; uuid.UUID is a Scanner destination, cursor-valued columns are not supported (closed-interface); Rows/Conn/Stmt release on drop and a dropped Tx rolls back; tests run against the fakedb port in examples/common/fakedb.rs",
